WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.060
- We were just talking about
being stuck in a bucket.

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:04.381
Have you ever been stuck
like that in anything?

00:00:04.381 --> 00:00:06.792
- Not in a bucket.

00:00:06.792 --> 00:00:11.200
This past year, I was hosting
the NAACP Image Awards

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.550
and literally five minutes
before the live show,

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:17.410
me and my entire family and security

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:19.050
were stuck in the elevator.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:20.301
- Okay, I was going to
say it was an elevator.

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:21.290
I've been stuck in an elevator.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:23.290
- Yeah, stuck in the elevator

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.548
and it took three and a
half minutes to get us out.

00:00:25.548 --> 00:00:26.381
- [Kelly] Oh!

00:00:26.381 --> 00:00:30.280
So we had a minute and a half
before the show went live.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.810
And once I got out, the
elevator dropped back down

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:33.643
to the basement.

00:00:33.643 --> 00:00:35.010
So then I had to run up the stairs.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:38.790
And as I ran up the stairs, I
saw the producers talking to,

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:42.210
I hope I pronounce her name
correctly, Leticia Right,

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:44.953
from, uh, um, um.

00:00:46.587 --> 00:00:49.174
- [Kelly] This is like
me every day right now.

00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:51.427
- Oh Covid, damn you Covid.

00:00:51.427 --> 00:00:52.856
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:52.856 --> 00:00:56.607
- Damn you Covid test diggin'
in my nose to my brain.

00:00:56.607 --> 00:00:57.440
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.678
- Black Panther, oh my God,

00:00:58.678 --> 00:01:00.880
she was in Black Panther
and so the producers

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:02.230
were huddled in the corner.

00:01:03.111 --> 00:01:04.664
- What a great movie.

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:05.970
- Trying to figure out what
they were going to tell,

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:07.410
how she was going to start the show

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.243
if I was still stuck in the elevator.

00:01:08.243 --> 00:01:11.245
- Oh my gosh, that is a
different level of panic.

00:01:11.245 --> 00:01:12.078
- Yeah.

00:01:12.078 --> 00:01:13.540
- Yeah, I'm not down for that.

